<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/poster/eswc-2026-print> ec:abstract "This poster presents Solid Cockpit as a client-side web interface designed to reduce the practical complexity of working with Solid Pods. It integrates key workflows for uploading and organizing data, managing access and privacy controls, and querying resources through SPARQL in a single environment, while preserving a decentralized architecture. The approach emphasizes usability for non-expert users without removing advanced capabilities needed for semantic data workflows." .
<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/poster/eswc-2026-print> ec:audienceExpertise "Semantic web and decentralized data researchers interested in practical interfaces for privacy-aware Solid ecosystems." .
