<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk-metadata/dph-day-talk> ec:abstract "This talk summarized ongoing research toward robust data interoperability for precision health applications using semantic web technologies. I highlighted progress across data representation, policy-aware sharing, and cross-source query workflows, with emphasis on clinical utility. The session connected technical decisions to broader implementation constraints in multidisciplinary healthcare environments." .
<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk-metadata/dph-day-talk> ec:audienceExpertise "Precision health researchers, clinicians collaborating with data teams, and applied data scientists." .
