<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk-metadata/sib-researchstay-reflection> ec:abstract "This reflection talk synthesized the primary outcomes of a focused research stay, including prototype results, methodological lessons, and areas for follow-up collaboration. I discussed what approaches translated well into practice and what bottlenecks remained when integrating decentralized data and federation tooling. The presentation also mapped concrete next steps into the broader PhD research timeline." .
