<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk-metadata/swissprot-talk> ec:abstract "This presentation examined how curated protein knowledge resources can be linked more effectively with distributed semantic data workflows. I discussed interoperability opportunities at the schema, identifier, and query orchestration levels, along with caveats around curation assumptions and endpoint behavior. The talk emphasized practical pathways for incremental integration rather than disruptive platform changes." .
