<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk/18m-vito-internal-jury> ec:description "This internal jury talk presented a structured review of progress against the first 18 months of the PhD trajectory. I summarized technical deliverables, empirical observations, and unresolved methodological risks across modeling, querying, and integration work packages. The presentation concluded with a revised execution plan for the next phase based on committee feedback and project constraints." .
