<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk/dph-day-talk> ec:description "This talk summarized ongoing research toward robust data interoperability for precision health applications using semantic web technologies. I highlighted progress across data representation, policy-aware sharing, and cross-source query workflows, with emphasis on clinical utility. The session connected technical decisions to broader implementation constraints in multidisciplinary healthcare environments." .
