<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk/eswc-phdsymp-pangquin> ec:description "This PhD symposium presentation outlined the end-to-end PENGQUIN research framework, from RDF representation of genomic data to policy-constrained decentralized querying. I detailed the central research questions, methodological plan, and validation strategy across realistic data-sharing scenarios. Feedback from the symposium was incorporated into subsequent prioritization of federation, policy modeling, and interoperability tasks." .
