<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk/solid-intro-triple-consortium> ec:description "This consortium talk provided an implementation-oriented introduction to Solid, with focus on identity, access control, and decentralized data interoperability. I connected Solid primitives to TRIPLE project objectives around federation and reusable data infrastructures. The session included concrete examples of how Solid-based resources can integrate with existing RDF and SPARQL workflows." .
