<https://eliascrum.github.io/eliascrum/id/talk/ugent-genomics-talk> ec:description "This talk introduced genomics concepts most relevant to computational audiences, including sequencing outputs, variant interpretation, and common data structures used in analysis pipelines. I mapped these foundations to challenges in representation, interoperability, and reproducibility that are central to modern data engineering. The session served as a bridge from domain fundamentals to semantic and decentralized research directions." .
